    "boundary": "HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 BaiTapService, BaiTapController \u2192 EF/SQL Server \u002B file sandbox",
    "baseline": "FR-31; SRS (3).docx.\nThi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF x\u1EED l\u00FD chi ti\u1EBFt (1).docx: UC3.4-U01 BaiTapController.Nop (b\u1EA3ng 179); UC3.4-U02 BaiTapService.NopAsync (b\u1EA3ng 181)\nNh\u00E1nh/kh\u1EDBp n\u1ED1i: N\u1ED9p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc v\u00E0 sau h\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ghi \u0111\u00FAng th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m",
    "strategy": "Bottom-up, BU3; th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 ch\u1EA1y #128.\nKi\u1EC3m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc: IT-097, IT-157\nGh\u00E9p sau: HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 BaiTapService, BaiTapController \u2192 EF/SQL Server \u002B file sandbox\nC\u0103n c\u1EE9: Sau Service\u2013DB v\u00E0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp li\u00EAn quan, gh\u00E9p HTTP/MVC \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m binding, cookie, antiforgery v\u00E0 chuy\u1EC3n k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 th\u00E0nh response. Kh\u00F4ng t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u00E3 sinh \u1EDF TC ti\u00EAn quy\u1EBFt; m\u1ED7i TC/DL fixture \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.",
    "conditions": "Fixture F7 \u002B F0; to\u00E0n b\u1ED9 DL d\u00F9ng fixture ri\u00EAng.\nDL01 H1 n\u1ED9p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc HanNopLuc; DL02 HanNopLuc \u0111\u00E3 qua nh\u01B0ng l\u1EDBp c\u00F2n ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng; MaThaoTac m\u1EDBi m\u1ED7i DL.\nHuy=CancellationToken ri\u00EAng khi method c\u00F3 tham s\u1ED1. RV/stamp/Id l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB fixture th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng hard-code gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB gi\u1EA3.",
    "steps": "1. Ch\u1EA1y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc IT-097, IT-157; t\u1EA1o fixture F7 m\u1EDBi v\u00E0 host test tr\u1ECF DB n\u00E0y; ch\u1EC9 t\u1EAFt hai worker khi ca kh\u00F4ng ki\u1EC3m worker.\n2. D\u00F9ng WebApplicationFactory/host th\u1EADt v\u00E0 HttpClient HTTPS ri\u00EAng,AllowAutoRedirect=false. Actor/cookie theo TC; n\u1EBFu c\u00F3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp ph\u1EA3i qua Identity/cookie th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng fake authentication handler.\n3. GET form t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng c\u00F9ng client l\u1EA5y cookie CSRF v\u00E0 __RequestVerificationToken. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1ED1 \u00FD b\u1ECF token \u1EDF DL CSRF. Input: DL01 H1 n\u1ED9p tr\u01B0\u1EDBc HanNopLuc; DL02 HanNopLuc \u0111\u00E3 qua nh\u01B0ng l\u1EDBp c\u00F2n ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng; MaThaoTac m\u1EDBi m\u1ED7i DL.\n4. POST n\u1ED9i dung/t\u1EC7p theo F7; \u0111\u1ECDc NopLuc SQL v\u00E0 tr\u1EA1ng th\u00E1i hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB. \u0110i\u1EC3m v\u00E0o: POST /HocTap/BaiTap/Nop. Nghi\u1EC7p v\u1EE5 d\u00F9ng AJAX; auth form gi\u1EEF form th\u01B0\u1EDDng; multipart \u0111\u00FAng t\u00EAn field khi c\u00F3 file.\n5. Ghi raw status,Content-Type,Location/body tr\u01B0\u1EDBc redirect r\u1ED3i assert contract: 200 ok=true c\u1EA3 hai; DL02 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u00E1nh d\u1EA5u n\u1ED9p mu\u1ED9n, kh\u00F4ng b\u1ECB t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i ch\u1EC9 do qu\u00E1 h\u1EA1n.\n6. \u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng context/connection \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp; Oracle: SELECT * FROM dbo.BaiTapGiao WHERE LopHocId=@C1; SELECT * FROM dbo.BaiTapNop WHERE BaiTapGiaoId=@A1 ORDER BY LanNop; SELECT * FROM dbo.KetQuaChamBai WHERE BaiTapNopId IN(SELECT Id FROM dbo.BaiTapNop WHERE BaiTapGiaoId=@A1); SELECT * FROM dbo.TepDinhKem WHERE BaiTapGiaoId=@A1 OR BaiTapNopId=@SUBMISSION;\n7. Assert d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u li\u00EAn th\u00F4ng v\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED5i: \u0110\u00FAng b\u00E0i/actor/m\u00E3 thao t\u00E1c; h\u1EA1n sau k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc bu\u1ED5i v\u1EABn h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7; kh\u00F4ng thay HanNopLuc \u0111\u1EC3 che mu\u1ED9n.\n8. Ghi trace/request/test name v\u00E0 TRX,SQL tr\u01B0\u1EDBc\u2013sau,file hash. D\u1EEBng host/worker,\u0111\u1EE3i k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc scope r\u1ED3i reset fixture/sandbox; kh\u00F4ng ch\u00E9p k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 Pass t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 kh\u00E1c.",
    "expected": "1. Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i / h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng: 200 ok=true c\u1EA3 hai; DL02 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u00E1nh d\u1EA5u n\u1ED9p mu\u1ED9n, kh\u00F4ng b\u1ECB t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i ch\u1EC9 do qu\u00E1 h\u1EA1n.\n2. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 side effect: \u0110\u00FAng b\u00E0i/actor/m\u00E3 thao t\u00E1c; h\u1EA1n sau k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc bu\u1ED5i v\u1EABn h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7; kh\u00F4ng thay HanNopLuc \u0111\u1EC3 che mu\u1ED9n."
